# Factory LLM rules

Detail: `knowledge/factory-llm.md`. Why: ADR-0020, ADR-0028.

- Extend graphs/skills/knowledge under `api/llm/` — do not freestyle provider clients in `routes/`.
- Discovery War Room control flow lives in LangGraph (`graphs/discovery_war_room.py`); SSE façade stays thin.
- Pydantic I/O for graph inputs/outputs; live War Room nodes are LangChain agents (`create_agent` + local tools + structured envelope); mock LLM in tests.
- Cursor work uses skill `factory-llm` (parent only).
